## Input

```css
$suffix: ".active";
.card:not(.disabled)#{$suffix} { color: red; }
.card[data-state]#{$suffix} { color: blue; }
.card#{$suffix} { color: red; }
.card:hover#{$suffix} { color: red; }
.card:not(.disabled) #{$suffix} { color: red; }
.card[data-state]
#{$suffix} { color: blue; }
.card:not(.disabled)#{$suffix}Tail { color: red; }
.card[data-state]#{$suffix}#{$suffix} { color: blue; }
*#{$suffix} { color: red; }
.card:not(.disabled)#id { color: red; }
.card[data-state]#id { color: blue; }

```


